leeve in his own  laboratory that would then allow the  crew to escape the incoming Fleet of  Warships on top of that you might also  remember that Kuma has started running  away from the revolutionaries and has  most likely teleported himself towards  where Luffy and his daughter Bonnie are  because that happened exactly the moment  when vegapunk realized that the Agents  of cp0 had infiltrated the islands so  Kuma could be the one to save the crew  once again from kizeru just like he did  on sabaori archipelago and speaking of  that by the way there are a lot of  parallels with Saba ODI and enoslavi  during this Arc like cyborg Frankie vs  cyborg vegapunk the Ohara flashback  during and aslobby and the Ohara  flashback here Luchi vs Luffy version 2  centomaru kizeru and Kuma versus the  straw hats and this time it's sent omaro  Kuma and the straw hats against kizeru  and also there is a real chance that the  Revolutionary Army might show up here as  well again after all Dragon was chasing  after Kuma and trying to stop him from  leaving again and so in the end the  strawheads might just be able to escape  another time and we'll have to wait for  the battle against the Admirals for just  a little bit longer unless we have  option 2 here that is a little bit less  likely but my personal favorites since  the crew is about to set sail and kizaru  is coming with a fleet of ships there is  a chance that we might get to see the  first sea Battle in the history of one  piece I mean I know it sounds crazy but  even though one piece is a story about  Pirates and Marines sailing the giant  oceans of the world we haven't had a  single real sea Battle in the entire  story the closest we've gotten so far  was the crew being chased around like on  whole kick Island for instance so it  would be truly refreshing to see some  actual ship versus ship battle for a  change which would also give Frankie a  real chance to show off his technology  to vegapunk and this would of course  al